--- body ---
## Context

Filed from replicator ticket 0002 (raid 2ba62a, blind validation of
`/replicate assess`, 2026-11-25). Child of tracker 1552.

`skills/replicate/` exists (created 2026-11-25 16:35) but
`~/.claude/skills/replicate` does not: every other skill there is a symlink
into `~/.agents/skills/`. All four Claude Code assessor subagents got
"Unknown skill: replicate" from the Skill tool and had to read SKILL.md by
path, as the orchestrator's brief told them to. A session without such a
brief cannot run the skill at all.

## Request

Project `skills/replicate` into the Claude Code skills directory (rerun the
installer, or fix whatever step skipped it), and check whether the installer
projects new skills automatically.

## Exit criteria

- [x] `~/.claude/skills/replicate` resolves to `~/.agents/skills/replicate`.
- [x] The Skill tool loads `replicate` in a fresh Claude Code session.
